{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t海關昨日採取特別行動，打擊懷疑冒牌硬碟加工工場及儲存倉庫，檢獲約6800件懷疑冒牌硬碟，估計市值共約5000萬元，並拘捕6人。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n海關稍後舉行記者會，交代行動詳情。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：陳樂謙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T07:41:39.636785+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:20:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T09:57:56.675434+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:37:50.910897+00:00","content_hash":"d72b30d58ec7124215502d5bf6f2348c2ad0bd4764581f60c339958937509754","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}